``FunctionDef.getattr()`` and ``Lambda.getattr()`` no longer add the special
attribute to ``instance_attrs`` when an attribute such as ``__name__`` is both
assigned on the function and a special attribute. The stored list used to grow by
one on every lookup. ``ClassDef.repr_tree(ast_state=True)`` no longer raises
``AttributeError``.

Refs #3411
